### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "nickname": "현섭",
  "profileImage": "",
  "bio": "안녕하세요!"
}

### 회원가입 (2번 유저 만들기)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test2@test.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "nickname": "테스터2",
  "profileImage": "",
  "bio": "두번째 유저"
}

### 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test2@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 프로필 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/profile
